sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Q as Cyclotron queue
  participant W as Email worker
  participant Pol as Email send policy
  participant SES
  participant St as EmailStatus
  participant T as Email tracking
  Q->>W: job with state.send
  Note over W: fixed slot reads state.send,<br/>no second render<br/>Q6: tracking policy from state.send
  W->>Pol: check(send, delivery)
  alt skip: pause, suppression, preferences, sender
    Pol-->>W: skip reason
    W->>St: record(skipped), wait for Kafka
    W->>Q: ack
  else passes
    W->>SES: SendEmail
    alt SES throttles
      SES-->>W: throttled
      W->>St: record(waiting), wait for Kafka
      W->>Q: reschedule
    else accepted
      SES-->>W: MessageId
      W->>St: record(sent, MessageId), wait for Kafka<br/>$email_message_id on sent event
      W->>Q: ack
    end
  end
  SES-)T: SNS: delivered, bounced, complained
  Note over T: verify signature, message_id<br/>from signed tracking header<br/>Q6: capture policy from the header
  T->>St: record(feedback), wait for Kafka
  T-->>SES: 200, or 5xx so SNS retries
